This dataset includes artificial T1-weighted images as well as whole-brain structural maps
of VIP (volume of interacting proton) produced from the quantitative MRI software pipeline
which can be found at https://github.com/mezera/mrQ. Data were collected at the Princeton
Neuroscience Institute. qMRI and T1-weighted images are inherently aligned to one another 
within a given participant. Information about the scan can be found at the publication 
link here: